<view class="vc-page vc-home-page vc-home-focus">
  <view class="container">
    <view class="hero vc-focus-hero fade-up">
      <text class="eyebrow">训练入口</text>
      <text class="title">开始一轮语音训练</text>
      <text class="subtitle">先选顾客和场景，再直接开练。</text>

      <view class="vc-focus-launch">
        <view class="vc-focus-copy">
          <text class="vc-focus-title">现在就开始</text>
          <text class="vc-focus-note">推荐先用测试顾客和测试场景跑通一次完整流程。</text>
        </view>
        <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="handleStart">开始训练</button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section fade-up delay-1">
      <view class="section-head">
        <text class="section-title">训练资产</text>
        <text class="section-caption">顾客和场景拆成两个次级入口，首页不再堆解释。</text>
      </view>

      <view class="minimal-grid">
        <view class="card minimal-action-card" bindtap="handleProfiles">
          <text class="minimal-action-kicker">顾客</text>
          <text class="card-title">顾客档案</text>
          <text class="minimal-action-copy">先选训练对象，再开始对练。</text>
          <text class="minimal-action-link">进入顾客库</text>
        </view>

        <view class="card minimal-action-card" bindtap="handleSceneCards">
          <text class="minimal-action-kicker">场景</text>
          <text class="card-title">场景卡</text>
          <text class="minimal-action-copy">先定这轮练什么，避免临场乱切题。</text>
          <text class="minimal-action-link">进入场景库</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
